Subject: summary: configuring mail in 4.0a
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96076340321885





	Hi,

	I found the solution.

	When you use mailsetup, and configuring General relay mailer
	don't use the full name of your station DNS and mailer relay
	to be used like relay mailer.

	Why, because if you are using this and your client station use
	the same domain as the dns/and relay mailer server, the soft
	mailsetup make a query to the dns/and relayer mailer and subsitute
	the adress you putted by the address in DNS configuration .
	In this case , this is not the same, because my client station
	cannot work direclty with INTERNET.

	thank's
