(X_CreatePixmap).  People directed me to check for X11R6 and X11R5 bad
handshaking and to make sure the bit planes were set properly at 8 not
24.  This was not the problem.  We tracked it down to trying to use a
virtual screen larger than the screen pixel dimensions.  Funny it worked 
from some machines to others but not DEC to DEC.

Run            Viewed
Worked:
DEC ->         Xterm
DEC ->         Linux/X
SGI ->         Everything

Did not Work:
DEC ->         DEC
Sun(Solaris)-> Anything.

When we kept the virtual screen size within the actual limits, all
combinations worked.

Thanks for all insights

Dave
